{"concept": "Harness Engineer", "title": "Harness Engineer：AI 开发的装备大师", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{background:#0f1420;font-family:'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:100vh;color:#e0e6f0}.container{max-width:720px;width:90%;padding:20px}.title{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px;color:#fff}.subtitle{font-size:13px;text-align:center;color:#8a94a6;margin-bottom:24px}.scene{background:#1a2233;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #2a3550;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.scene::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4a9eff,#7c5cff)}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:16px 0}.col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex:1}.label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#aab4c6}.box{width:100%;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 10px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;border:2px solid transparent}.dev{background:#2a3550;border-color:#4a9eff;color:#cfe4ff}.harness{background:#1e2a3a;border-color:#7c5cff;color:#d6ccff;padding:18px 10px;position:relative}.harness .tools{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.tool{background:#2a3550;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px;color:#9fb4d8;border:1px solid #3a4a6a}.arrow{font-size:24px;color:#7c5cff;flex:0 0 auto}.target{background:#2a3550;border-color:#ffb84a;color:#ffe6b3}.vs{font-size:11px;color:#6a7a96;margin-top:6px;font-style:italic}.note{background:#141c2c;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:#aab4c6;border-left:3px solid #7c5cff;line-height:1.7}.note strong{color:#fff}.legend{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:20px;margin-top:14px;font-size:11px;color:#8a94a6}.legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}.dot1{background:#4a9eff}.dot2{background:#7c5cff}.dot3{background:#ffb84a}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"title\">🎒 Harness Engineer = AI 开发的装备大师</div><div class=\"subtitle\">让你不裸奔上战场</div><div class=\"scene\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"label\">🧑‍💻 开发者</div><div class=\"box dev\">写业务代码<br><span style=\"font-size:11px;opacity:0.7\">（你的英雄）</span></div></div><div class=\"arrow\">➡️</div><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"label\">🛠️ Harness（工具箱）</div><div class=\"box harness\">框架 + 工具链 + 流程<br><div class=\"tools\"><span class=\"tool\">RAG</span><span class=\"tool\">Prompt</span><span class=\"tool\">测试</span><span class=\"tool\">监控</span></div></div></div><div class=\"arrow\">➡️</div><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"label\">🎯 目标</div><div class=\"box target\">AI 应用上线<br><span style=\"font-size:11px;opacity:0.7\">（推塔胜利）</span></div></div></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><span class=\"dot dot1\"></span>开发者</span><span><span class=\"dot dot2\"></span>Harness 装备</span><span><span class=\"dot dot3\"></span>目标</span></div></div><div class=\"note\"><strong>装备大师的工作：</strong>选好工具（RAG/向量库）、配好流程（测试/监控）、调好参数（温度/上下文），让开发者专注写业务逻辑，不用从零造轮子。就像三角洲里，<strong>后勤兵帮你配好枪和弹药</strong>，你只管冲锋。</div></div></body></html>"}